    "_doc": "The translucent fills restated for the engine's UI pass, which blends flat fills in linear light: each the alpha whose linear blend over `over` draws what CSS's blend of the `color` value draws there (a white 13 % over dark glass reads about three times as strong in linear light). The engine draws these; a browser draws `color`.",
